o the masses and not just to the  privileged few the al matter declaration  on primary health care now ten years old  clearly mapped out the road on which we  are firmly engaged people everywhere  from north to south east to west  recognize beyond all the differences  that health is good for all people and  essentially indeed for human progress  that there is both economic value  and social justice in health sure we  must all recognize that even offense is  not everything  there is nothing will actress in the  interest of the human race  there must be health for all and all for  health  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

